{"title":"2024 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 6","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2_(From_Official_Solution)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2 (From Official Solution)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Verifying_Answer\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Verifying Answer</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Three inhabitants of planet Magu named Alpha, Beta, and Gamma, met in a crater and counted each others eyes. Alpha saw exactly <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> eyes, Beta saw exactly <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/8/c6878713578626763c38433b3f4c8c2205ad0c15.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> eyes, and Gamma saw exactly <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> eyes. No one could see their own eyes. How many eyes does Alpha have?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/1/311cabda3a9b09f0dde217303ca9d1cd9201dcf6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$g$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> be the number of eyes that Alpha, Beta, and Gamma have, respectively.\n</p><p>Because Alpha saw <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> eyes, Beta saw <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/8/c6878713578626763c38433b3f4c8c2205ad0c15.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> eyes, and Gamma saw <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> eyes and all of them couldn't see their own eyes, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/a/7ea8f9c71214bc994b8d9f8fd600d953e4416eb2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b + g = 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"75\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/4/5/245e7164a147990cac6d1c063302052ad6813dff.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a + g = 11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"85\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/5/d75a0d4e0b7d4f52b40f2ff13e211786acc71de0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a + b = 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"72\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p>We can notice that the last two equations have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/1/311cabda3a9b09f0dde217303ca9d1cd9201dcf6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$g$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> and that they have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> twice and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/1/311cabda3a9b09f0dde217303ca9d1cd9201dcf6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$g$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> once. Thus, we can add them together:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/3/7d3b4fe58f4ba38355aaaf0e96a6125eaf954c12.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a + g + a + b = 11 + 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"179\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/3/2/b32d5c895a56ac17c0e3c005b84ae54f9825d140.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b + g + 2a = 19$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"125\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>Plugging in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/a/7ea8f9c71214bc994b8d9f8fd600d953e4416eb2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b + g = 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"75\" height=\"18\" /> into the equation, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/a/e2aafedfd64a56e3c3daa7e7806514d873121797.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9 + 2a = 19$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"94\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/e/c3ec33aa4d70f4cd190f85399f59bb8b92d82922.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2a = 19 - 9 = 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"137\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/e/d8e9b4f13f2ddc616707b65260115f12fa1df0df.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = \\frac{10}{2} = \\boxed{5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"102\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2_.28From_Official_Solution.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_(From_Official_Solution)\">Solution 2 (From Official Solution)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2 (From Official Solution)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can use the same\n</p><p>We can notice that for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/a/7ea8f9c71214bc994b8d9f8fd600d953e4416eb2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b + g = 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"75\" height=\"18\" />, there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> possibilities for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/8/7984fba8e21eaeb1c5d5d9f8abaa5e57689e892d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(b, g)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"41\" height=\"20\" />:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/8/3/a830e29a86b89f6aa7605913a2188b0e40e8b94b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(1, 8)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"42\" height=\"20\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/e/a2eb08294f9f403a87b79433484ef30dcf6a27cb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2, 7)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"42\" height=\"20\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/8/1/281cb98ef359560b94673052664a637c131ec362.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(3, 6)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"42\" height=\"20\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/b/1/6b148ef6cc1c0ce3aebeede22fd06969a213bd5e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(4, 5)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/9/bf953fb2c072b3fd3f9daad973c7e1ee5fc53aff.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(5, 4)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"42\" height=\"20\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/9/3/e936447969453c86785fddfee03c502514fa298f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(6, 3)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/9/69934078855b3f4abb72a7be0288becf5fcf545e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(7, 2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"42\" height=\"20\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/8/2b8507d7d45400a0565889da66e6fca555aa7485.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(8, 1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>However, since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/4/5/245e7164a147990cac6d1c063302052ad6813dff.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a + g = 11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"85\" height=\"17\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/5/d75a0d4e0b7d4f52b40f2ff13e211786acc71de0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a + b = 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"72\" height=\"14\" />, Beta must see <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/f/2/cf2e4396e5c4f86e4d024354540a4ed1fa13b37f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$11 - 8 = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"85\" height=\"15\" /> less eyes than Gamma. From the list of possibilities, this occurs when <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/4/6/246ec286b9641f91f9dfa14932e47171e2fad854.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = 3$\" width=\"40\" height=\"12\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/d/99d1dd34b2e9ce104dafc6cb9de0b7dffff20d39.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$g = 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"44\" height=\"17\" />.\n</p><p>Thus:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/2/d/92d288df03e76d1d578c1cd136e6877869e8c80b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a + 3 = 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"76\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/6/b/46b93a1d79575089473cb0bc5105d8a63a593002.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a + 6 = 11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"85\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p>From both, we see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/0/5007a4674b0c57987c3a545432f839bd38965d8e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = 8 - 3 = \\boxed{5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"121\" height=\"25\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/2/5325544d9af3beb0a43dfaf765de47822f91c0a9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = 11 - 6 = \\boxed{5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"130\" height=\"25\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher and CEMC\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Verifying_Answer\">Verifying Answer</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Verifying Answer\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/7/2/e72e2e58a2ef8bb4eedd627c212f63bb8f507301.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = 5$\" width=\"42\" height=\"12\" />, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/a/7ea8f9c71214bc994b8d9f8fd600d953e4416eb2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b + g = 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"75\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/d/5/1d5c3faccb630462d486166ed313c74368d3d3bd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5 + g = 11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"85\" height=\"17\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/f/f1ff6b4a16dd3aeca059a995067809525f00662e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5 + b = 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"74\" height=\"16\" />\n</p><p>From the last equation, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/6/1/d61554563f18c499668a733b83ac2487e5e6b685.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = 8 - 5 = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"108\" height=\"16\" />. From the second equation, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/5/c05c8935567e9cb49fe6f5f426e3da97d12e0719.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$g = 11 - 5 = 6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"118\" height=\"17\" />.\n</p><p>Since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/3/d835f5e1fff3d9ab7a0f23cf9900d26d8e8b17ae.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3 + 6 = 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"73\" height=\"14\" /> too, the equations work, and our answer has been verified.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC\" title=\"2024 CEMC TUC\">2024 CEMC TUC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CEMC TUC Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CEMC TUC Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2024 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 7 (page does not exist)\">Problem 7</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2024 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2024 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2024 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 4 (page does not exist)\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2024 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CEMC TUC Problems/Problem 7 (page does not exist)\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?tit